              <span id="alg1.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each inputs, targets in batches <span id="alg1.l6.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
              <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline"><span id="alg1.l7.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:80%;">7:</span></span>
              
              
               <span id="alg1.l7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> not motivated <span id="alg1.l7.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>



